{"blocks":[["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/","source-block-558","Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03 Bottom/01 Octave/Button/Down",["Octave","Controls"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/","source-block-622","Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03 Bottom/01 Octave/Button/Up",["Octave","Controls"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/","source-block-684","Source",["Octave"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/","source-block-697","Microfreak/UG/03 Overview/01 Front Panel/03 Bottom Row/01 Octave Select",["Octave","Source"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/","source-block-777","Microfreak/UG/10 Keyboard/04 Octave Buttons",["Octave","Source"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Asset/Panel/png/","source-block-43","Octave on the panel",[]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Asset/Panel/png/","source-block-214","Cropped from Microfreak/UG/03 Overview/01 Front Panel/03 Bottom Row/Asset/01-Bottom-row-of-the-MicroFreak/png.",["Octave on the panel"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Button/Down/","source-block-99","Octave Down button",[]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Button/Down/","source-block-122","Shifts the keyboard one octave down, as far as three octaves.",["Octave Down button"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Button/Down/","source-block-362","Behavior",["Octave Down button"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Button/Down/","source-block-377","The buttons blink faster the farther the shift is from zero.",["Octave Down button","Behavior"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Button/Down/","source-block-442","Values",["Octave Down button"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Button/Down/","source-block-455","Each press lowers the shift by one, as far as -3, and the OLED shows the new value. Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03 Bottom/01 Octave/Ref/Key Range lists the notes the keys send at each value.",["Octave Down button","Values"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Button/Down/","source-block-650","Source",["Octave Down button"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Button/Down/","source-block-663","Microfreak/UG/10 Keyboard/04 Octave Buttons",["Octave Down button","Source"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Button/Down/","source-block-715","Microfreak/UG/03 Overview/01 Front Panel/03 Bottom Row/01 Octave Select",["Octave Down button","Source"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Button/Down/Asset/Panel/png/","source-block-43","Octave Down button on the panel",[]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Button/Down/Asset/Panel/png/","source-block-254","Cropped from Microfreak/UG/03 Overview/01 Front Panel/03 Bottom Row/Asset/01-Bottom-row-of-the-MicroFreak/png.",["Octave Down button on the panel"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Button/Up/","source-block-99","Octave Up button",[]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Button/Up/","source-block-120","Shifts the keyboard one octave up, as far as three octaves.",["Octave Up button"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Button/Up/","source-block-354","Behavior",["Octave Up button"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Button/Up/","source-block-369","The buttons blink faster the farther the shift is from zero.",["Octave Up button","Behavior"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Button/Up/","source-block-434","Values",["Octave Up button"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Button/Up/","source-block-447","Each press raises the shift by one, as far as +3, and the OLED shows the new value. Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03 Bottom/01 Octave/Ref/Key Range lists the notes the keys send at each value.",["Octave Up button","Values"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Button/Up/","source-block-642","Source",["Octave Up button"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Button/Up/","source-block-655","Microfreak/UG/10 Keyboard/04 Octave Buttons",["Octave Up button","Source"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Button/Up/","source-block-707","Microfreak/UG/03 Overview/01 Front Panel/03 Bottom Row/01 Octave Select",["Octave Up button","Source"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Button/Up/Asset/Panel/png/","source-block-43","Octave Up button on the panel",[]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Button/Up/Asset/Panel/png/","source-block-248","Cropped from Microfreak/UG/03 Overview/01 Front Panel/03 Bottom Row/Asset/01-Bottom-row-of-the-MicroFreak/png.",["Octave Up button on the panel"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Ref/Key%20Range/","source-block-229","Octave key range reference",[]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Ref/Key%20Range/","source-block-260","The notes the MicroFreak's 25 keys send at each octave shift, from -3 to +3, as the Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/01 Top/04 OLED shows it. Note names follow Music/Concept/Scientific Pitch Notation, where MIDI note 60 is C4, middle C. MIDI note numbers are in parentheses.",["Octave key range reference"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Ref/Key%20Range/","source-block-537","When the OLED shows -1",["Octave key range reference"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Ref/Key%20Range/","source-block-566","The lowest key sends C2 (36), the C in the middle of the keyboard sends C3 (48), and the highest key sends C4 (60), middle C.",["Octave key range reference","When the OLED shows -1"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Ref/Key%20Range/","source-block-696","Arturia's manual and name the same three notes C1, C2 and C3.",["Octave key range reference","When the OLED shows -1"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Ref/Key%20Range/","source-block-779","Every octave",["Octave key range reference"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Ref/Key%20Range/","source-block-798","The center key is the C in the middle of the keyboard, the 13th key from the left.",["Octave key range reference","Every octave"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Ref/Key%20Range/","source-block-1448","Arturia and Ableton octave numbers",["Octave key range reference"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Ref/Key%20Range/","source-block-1489","Arturia's manual and Ableton Live name MIDI note 60 C3, so each of their octave numbers is one below scientific pitch notation. The MicroFreak 5.0 manual gives the full MIDI range, notes 0 to 127, as C−2 to G8 in Microfreak/UG/06 Dig Osc/01 as Soundgen.",["Octave key range reference","Arturia and Ableton octave numbers"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Ref/Key%20Range/","source-block-1753","Sources",["Octave key range reference"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Ref/Key%20Range/","source-block-1767","Microfreak/UG/10 Keyboard/04 Octave Buttons — the buttons shift the keys up to three octaves either way, and the keys reach eight octaves in all.",["Octave key range reference","Sources"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Ref/Key%20Range/","source-block-1923","MicroFreak user manual 1.0, section 6.1, The oscillator as a sound generator — gives the range the shifted keys reach as C−1 to C7 in Arturia's names, MIDI 12 to 108. The lowest key at -3 is C−1, the highest key at +3 is C7, and octave 0 sits three octaves in from each end, at C2 to C4 in Arturia's names.",["Octave key range reference","Sources"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Ref/Key%20Range/","source-block-2331","Microfreak/UG/06 Dig Osc/01 as Soundgen — the 5.0 manual's C−2 to G8 for MIDI 0 to 127 shows that Arturia names MIDI 60 C3.",["Octave key range reference","Sources"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Ref/Key%20Range/","source-block-2467","Recorded sessions",["Octave key range reference"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Ref/Key%20Range/","source-block-2491","GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun at 05:15 — Microfreak/Preset/259 Infini Pad with the OLED at -2, as codekiln noted. The keys send G1 (31) and F1 (29), inside the -2 row.",["Octave key range reference","Recorded sessions"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Ref/Key%20Range/","source-block-2671","GitP/A/Session/26/10/29-Thu at 10:32 — Microfreak/Preset/138 Metallic Talk, saved at -2, opens on the keys with G1 (31) and F1 (29), inside the -2 row.",["Octave key range reference","Recorded sessions"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Ref/Key%20Range/","source-block-2837","GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun at 18:22 — Microfreak/Preset/260 8bitfi, saved at +2, opens with C6 to E6 (84 to 88), inside the +2 row.",["Octave key range reference","Recorded sessions"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Ref/Key%20Range/","source-block-2984","GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun at 01:59 — Infini Pad, saved at 0, plays G5 to C6 (79 to 84), which sits in the +1 row. An Octave Up press before 01:59 would account for it; the MIDI does not record octave button presses.",["Octave key range reference","Recorded sessions"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Ref/Key%20Range/","source-block-3212","Uncertainty",["Octave key range reference"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Ref/Key%20Range/","source-block-3230","Arturia publishes no note number for any single key. The table reads the 1.0 manual's C−1 to C7 in the naming the 5.0 manual uses.",["Octave key range reference","Uncertainty"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Ref/Key%20Range/","source-block-3367","The recordings agree with the table. A range one octave higher puts G1 and F1 outside the -2 row at 05:15. A range one octave lower puts 8bitfi's opening D♯6 and E6 outside its saved +2 row.",["Octave key range reference","Uncertainty"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Ref/Key%20Range/","source-block-3564","A MIDI monitor settles it: at octave 0 the lowest key should send note 48.",["Octave key range reference","Uncertainty"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/02%20Shift%20Button/","source-block-89","Shift button",[]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/02%20Shift%20Button/","source-block-106","Gives other controls their second function, printed in blue on the panel.",["Shift button"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/02%20Shift%20Button/","source-block-344","Behavior",["Shift button"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/02%20Shift%20Button/","source-block-359","Momentary: hold it while using another control.",["Shift button","Behavior"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/02%20Shift%20Button/","source-block-411","Source",["Shift button"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/02%20Shift%20Button/","source-block-424","Microfreak/UG/03 Overview/01 Front Panel/03 Bottom Row/02 Shift",["Shift button","Source"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/02%20Shift%20Button/","source-block-496","Microfreak/UG/20 Appendix C - Cheat Sheet",["Shift button","Source"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/02%20Shift%20Button/Asset/Panel/png/","source-block-43","Shift button on the panel",[]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/02%20Shift%20Button/Asset/Panel/png/","source-block-234","Cropped from Microfreak/UG/03 Overview/01 Front Panel/03 Bottom Row/Asset/01-Bottom-row-of-the-MicroFreak/png.",["Shift button on the panel"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/03%20Arp%20Seq/","source-block-86","Arp Seq",[]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/03%20Arp%20Seq/","source-block-98","The Arpeggiator and Sequencer section of the bottom row.",["Arp Seq"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/03%20Arp%20Seq/","source-block-311","Controls",["Arp Seq"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/03%20Arp%20Seq/","source-block-326","Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03 Bottom/03 Arp Seq/Button/Arp Seq",["Arp Seq","Controls"]],["Micr